---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const canonicalUrl = new URL("/privacy/", Astro.site).href;
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Gacha Countdown. We use Google AdSense to serve ads and Google Analytics to analyze traffic. Learn how your data is handled and how to opt out."
  url={canonicalUrl}
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
>
  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-100 mb-6 sm:mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">
        1. Data We Collect
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        We do not collect, store, or share any personal information such as
        your name, email address, or account details. We do not require any
        registration to use this site.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        Your game visibility preferences (which games are shown or hidden on
        the dashboard) are stored locally in your browser using
        <code class="text-slate-200 bg-white/[0.05] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">localStorage</code>.
        This data never leaves your device.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        We do not sell, rent, or trade any personal data to any third party.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">2. Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        We use third-party cookies and similar technologies for advertising and
        analytics purposes. Specifically, this site uses Google AdSense and
        Google Analytics as described below. These cookies are only loaded
        after you accept our cookie consent banner.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">
        3. Google AdSense Advertising Cookies
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        Google AdSense is a third-party advertising service used to display ads
        on this site. AdSense may use cookies (such as the DoubleClick cookie)
        to serve advertisements based on your prior visits to this website and
        other websites on the internet. This allows Google and its partners to
        show you personalized ads.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads
        Settings at{" "}
        <a
          href="https://adssettings.google.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:text-primary/80 underline underline-offset-2"
        >adssettings.google.com</a>{" "}
        or the opt-out page at{" "}
        <a
          href="https://www.aboutads.info"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:text-primary/80 underline underline-offset-2"
        >www.aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">
        4. Google Analytics
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        This site uses Google Analytics
        (measurement ID <code class="text-slate-200 bg-white/[0.05] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">G-DE7X8J5NY6</code>)
        to understand how visitors use the site. Google Analytics collects
        information such as pages viewed, session duration, approximate
        location, and traffic sources. This data is aggregated and used to
        improve the site.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base mt-3">
        You can opt out of Google Analytics across all websites by installing
        the Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on, available at{" "}
        <a
          href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:text-primary/80 underline underline-offset-2"
        >tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">
        5. Third-Party Services
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        We use Google (AdSense and Analytics) as third-party service providers.
        These services operate under their own privacy policies. You can review
        Google's privacy policy at{" "}
        <a
          href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-primary hover:text-primary/80 underline underline-offset-2"
        >policies.google.com/privacy</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-5 sm:mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-200 mb-2">
        6. Changes to This Policy
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted
        on this page. We recommend reviewing it periodically.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono mt-8">
      Last updated: September 21, 2026
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>